id=softap_5g_fix
name=SoftAP 5GHz Fix (JP / HyperOS)
version=1.0
versionCode=1
author=trprkkk
description=Removes MIUI's Japan-only 2.4GHz SoftAP forcing by patching miui-wifi-service.jar, and pins the Wi-Fi country code to JP so 5GHz tethering works without a 5GHz upstream. Based on MiuiWifiApManager/MiuiWifiService analysis for curtana (Redmi Note 9S).
